      "created_at": "2021-07-12T02:06:52.993Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Starting a petition to the RPG editors to make all future printings of the SCRPG character sheet have the following change.</p>\n<p>Right above the two Principles, in the Green Abilities, put a new ability that reads<br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/940593722b0a68159dd58481585d739ebb4d3453.png?v=9\" title=\":defend:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom\" alt=\":defend:\">  : “Hit The Deck” : R : Defend against an attack by rolling a single appropriate [Power or Quality or Status] die. Take a minor twist.</p>\n<p>Every character has access to this ability, but not every player will remember they have access to it. Does anyone else think this is something they should do?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-07-14T18:42:48.087Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
