    {
      "id": 239217,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-07-12T13:57:30.565Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\" data-post=\"6\" data-topic=\"28671\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It’s whatever makes sense in that moment to use.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>And that’s the only reason I haven’t added it to mine. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> There’s no specific die to use, so I can’t concretely define it as a “power”. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Conceptually, I like it, and I hope they look for a way to represent it on an updated character sheet at some point – and maybe we can help them come up with it. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Maybe it’s as simple as something like:<br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/shield.png?v=12\" title=\":shield:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":shield:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> : “Hit The Deck” : R : Defend against an attack by rolling a single appropriate Power, Quality, or Status die. Take a minor twist.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-07-12T13:58:56.576Z",
