      "raw": "[quote=\"Powerhound_2000, post:6, topic:28671\"]\nIt’s whatever makes sense in that moment to use.\n[/quote]\n\nAnd that's the only reason I haven't added it to mine. :confused: There's no specific die to use, so I can't concretely define it as a \"power\". :( \n\nConceptually, I like it, and I hope they look for a way to represent it on an updated character sheet at some point -- and maybe we can help them come up with it. :D Maybe it's as simple as something like: \n:shield: : “Hit The Deck” : R : Defend against an attack by rolling a single appropriate Power, Quality, or Status die. Take a minor twist.",
