      "created_at": "2021-07-12T17:31:55.950Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It doesn’t say that you can use your status die either. Any other time the game has you pick dice they have to come from your powers and qualities.</p>\n<p>This is another thing that it might be worth asking them for clarification on.</p>",
