      "created_at": "2021-07-12T19:18:23.668Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, in a vacuum, I see Status die as the very last option, but I can also easily see a case for it specifically in the Red Zone, i.e. “I NEED to dodge this attack so that I have a chance to repair the engines of this mobile defense platform before we all crash into the ocean and die…” Things are desperate in the Red Zone, so the thematics of it applying to the defense roll make sense to me.</p>",
